      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "Find the domain of $t(x)=5\\sqrt[9]{12-7x}-2.$\n\n$x\\in ($\n{{field-1}},\n\n{{field-2}} $).$",
      "worked_solution": "The domain of $y=\\sqrt[9]{x}$ is\n$x\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$\n\nTransformations do not change this interval. Therefore, the domain of $t(x)$ is $x\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$",
